{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggeWikLBJEEfo89VS24w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**These bands can't be used to get Dq or B. A ligand-field (Tanabe–Sugano) fit does not apply to permanganate.**\n\n1. **Electron count.** In MnO₄⁻ the oxygens are O²⁻, so manganese is Mn(VII). Mn has 7 valence electrons, so Mn(VII) is **3d⁰**.\n2. **No d–d transitions are possible.** With no d electrons there is no free-ion term structure (no ⁴F, ³F and so on) and no ligand-field multiplets. Tanabe–Sugano diagrams only cover d²–d⁸. A d⁰ ion has no term energies that depend on Dq, B or C, so its spectrum carries no information about them.\n3. **What the bands are.** The strong absorptions (ε of about 1,500–3,000 M⁻¹ cm⁻¹) are ligand-to-metal charge-transfer (LMCT) bands. Electrons move from oxygen-based nonbonding orbitals (t₁, then t₂) into the empty Mn 3d-based e and t₂ orbitals of the tetrahedron:\n   - about 17,570 cm⁻¹: ¹A₁ → ¹T₂ (t₁ → e), which gives the purple colour\n   - about 31,560 cm⁻¹ and 38,320 cm⁻¹: higher LMCT transitions (t₁ → t₂ and t₂ → e)\n\n   Spin-allowed d–d bands in tetrahedral complexes have ε of only about 10²–10³ M⁻¹ cm⁻¹ (in octahedral complexes, ε < 100). These intensities fit charge transfer, not d–d transitions.\n4. **What this means for the fit.** If you fed these energies into a d–d fit for any dⁿ configuration, you would get Dq and B values that look precise but mean nothing. The energy gaps between LMCT bands do depend partly on the e/t₂ splitting, but only within a molecular-orbital treatment, not the ligand-field term model. Getting a meaningful tetrahedral Δ for Mn(VII) would need a molecular-orbital or TD-DFT analysis, not a Racah-parameter fit.\n\n{\"Dq\": null, \"B\": null, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": true, \"reason\": \"MnO4- is d0 Mn(VII); the bands are charge-transfer, not d-d, so a ligand-field fit for Dq and B does not apply.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":253,"cache_read_input_tokens":7806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54798c52-4b89-4435-b499-7d7abccdf4de","uuid":"49b9c99f-0f5f-41ac-88af-93f4a3d4b320","timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:45:07.665Z","request_id":"req_011CggeWiQzFpAimHswhDVuD"}
